Hi Jill,

You have 3 models in your list of models FITZ and 3 colors in your array of colors c("red","purple","blue"), and the colors are matched one-to-one in order. Here it is by increasing AIC, but that is because ctmm.select returns a sorted list of models. If you apply rev() to the model list or color array argument, then the colors will run in reverse. The plot method doesn't do any extra sorting.

Best,
Chris

